Get runtime logs for a project or deployment. Runtime logs show application output (console.log, errors, etc.) from serverless functions and edge functions during execution. Supports filtering by environment, log level, status code, source, time range, and full-text search. For wide time ranges, scope to a deploymentId for speed, or use group_by to get counts instead of individual lines. To investigate production errors specifically, prefer get_runtime_errors. This tool is part of plugin `Vercel`.

exec tool declaration:
